{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute. [[cite:obs-98b3220a840068062d5f8cf1e000b47ff8259aa5 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]\n\nThe statute's retention rule is that records are kept according to the schedule defined within the statute itself. [[cite:obs-98b3220a840068062d5f8cf1e000b47ff8259aa5 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]\n\nThe exact duration for which the records are kept is specified in that schedule, but the statute text does not provide a specific number of years. [[cite:obs-98b3220a840068062d5f8cf1e000b47ff8259aa5 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"6d684a4d52fa44f39cc76fcfe49c6417a2881c94d3eb4776311b1544aa2deeeb","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added explicit statements about the statute's retention rule and record retention duration, each supported by the exact source quote from obs-98b3220a840068062d5f8cf1e000b47ff8259aa5, as required. No unsupported claims or changes to sources."}